---
// An AstroMX component calling a discovered custom tag (`src/tags/badge.mx`).
// Astro only treats an upper-case-led tag name as a component, so the host
// binds the tag under such a name; before that, the page shipped a literal
// `<$mx_Badge1 />` element and nothing failed.
---
<h1>Custom tag</h1>
<p class="first"><badge label="one"/></p>
<p class="second"><badge label="two"/></p>
